1
00:00:07,289 --> 00:00:25,990
你哋見到約翰？

2
00:00:29,339 --> 00:00:32,419
Guess I'll
have to kill you

3
00:02:23,202 --> 00:02:30,043
Guess I've seen
something that I wasn't supposed to see

4
00:02:30,283 --> 00:02:32,724
I'm thinking it
was that sweetlooking blonde boy

5
00:02:32,764 --> 00:02:35,084
I saw in
Dusseldorf a year ago

6
00:02:35,604 --> 00:02:36,805
Because I've
seen Johann

7
00:02:36,845 --> 00:02:38,285
this is how
it ends up

8
00:02:38,325 --> 00:02:40,045
That's how it
works with you

9
00:02:43,574 --> 00:02:46,535
It was dark and
raining when I heard those three gunshots

10
00:02:46,575 --> 00:02:49,576
I was there alone
and got scared so I ran away

11
00:02:49,976 --> 00:02:53,658
At the time I was
pretty certain it was Tenma who'd been shot dead

12
00:02:54,058 --> 00:02:56,859
But the next day
there was this big article in the newspaper

13
00:02:56,899 --> 00:03:00,221
Saying that a man named Junkers had been found dead in the same location

14
00:03:00,261 --> 00:03:02,541
And that he'd
been shot three times

15
00:03:03,062 --> 00:03:05,342
So then that boy
did it didn't he？

16
00:03:08,144 --> 00:03:10,545
Might want to
rethink pulling that trigger

17
00:03:13,168 --> 00:03:13,929
If you kill me

18
00:03:13,969 --> 00:03:15,971
you'll never get
what you really want

19
00:03:16,011 --> 00:03:17,973
That photograph
you've been looking for

20
00:03:18,013 --> 00:03:20,214
The one of
Johan as a young boy

21
00:03:21,376 --> 00:03:24,619
Let me tell you
what will happen if you do decide to kill me

22
00:03:24,659 --> 00:03:25,259
If I die

23
00:03:25,299 --> 00:03:27,381
I've arranged for
that photo you want so much

24
00:03:27,421 --> 00:03:29,903
To be delivered
directly to the BKA

25
00:03:30,344 --> 00:03:31,906
If you want to
see that photograph

26
00:03:31,946 --> 00:03:35,108
You need to tell
me exactly where Tenma can be found

27
00:03:47,021 --> 00:03:48,703
And just what
is so funny？

28
00:03:48,743 --> 00:03:50,984
Your whole
body's quivering

29
00:03:53,031 --> 00:03:53,952
You talk tough

30
00:03:53,992 --> 00:03:57,634
but your legs are
shaking so hard you can barely stand

31
00:04:03,480 --> 00:04:05,601
You really
do amuse me

32
00:04:06,082 --> 00:04:07,803
I'll tell
you where he is

33
00:04:08,964 --> 00:04:10,926
So what is
Tenma up to now？

34
00:04:10,966 --> 00:04:13,168
Oh，he's still
working as a doctor

35
00:04:13,208 --> 00:04:15,129
But our friend
has gone underground

36
00:04:15,169 --> 00:04:16,330
Where is he？

37
00:04:16,987 --> 00:04:18,627
There's this
older guy in Hanover

38
00:04:18,667 --> 00:04:22,426
who was the number two man in a certain organised crime family

39
00:04:22,466 --> 00:04:22,626
Well

40
00:04:22,666 --> 00:04:24,546
this guy's boss
kind of freaked out

41
00:04:24,586 --> 00:04:26,066
and put out
a hit on him

42
00:04:26,106 --> 00:04:28,105
But the job
got botched

43
00:04:28,185 --> 00:04:29,225
The guy got
all shut up

44
00:04:29,265 --> 00:04:30,745
but he didn't die

45
00:04:30,905 --> 00:04:34,864
So Temba's at
this remote alpine estate patching him up

46
00:04:34,904 --> 00:04:37,264
It's up on a
mountain near Fussen

47
00:05:03,550 --> 00:05:04,230
Excuse me

48
00:05:04,270 --> 00:05:06,591
but why did you
just stand there like that？

49
00:05:14,034 --> 00:05:14,755
Hey， Mister

50
00:05:14,795 --> 00:05:16,635
it's almost
time for lunch

51
00:05:27,487 --> 00:05:30,567
Why in the world
are we eating outside？

52
00:05:30,607 --> 00:05:32,087
I just thought

53
00:05:32,127 --> 00:05:34,607
the weather looks
so nice this afternoon

54
00:05:34,647 --> 00:05:37,408
Why not mix up
our routine and eat outside？

55
00:05:37,448 --> 00:05:39,528
Well，have our
lunch out here

56
00:05:39,568 --> 00:05:40,568
Didier

57
00:05:40,608 --> 00:05:42,728
go ahead and
bring the plates out here

58
00:05:42,768 --> 00:05:43,888
Okay

59
00:05:45,529 --> 00:05:47,529
All your wounds
are healing nicely

60
00:05:47,569 --> 00:05:49,769
and this fresh
air will do you good

61
00:05:51,449 --> 00:05:52,329
I have to say

62
00:05:52,369 --> 00:05:53,409
Doctor

63
00:05:53,490 --> 00:05:54,650
If you hadn'
t been there

64
00:05:54,690 --> 00:05:56,210
I doubt I
would have made it

65
00:05:56,250 --> 00:05:58,131
That country
clinic was pathetic

66
00:05:58,171 --> 00:05:59,931
But the masterful
skills you possess

67
00:05:59,971 --> 00:06:01,732
Allowed you
to save my life

68
00:06:01,772 --> 00:06:02,652
Maybe

69
00:06:02,692 --> 00:06:04,252
The one bullet
just grazed your head

70
00:06:04,292 --> 00:06:05,653
And the other one
went into your leg

71
00:06:05,693 --> 00:06:07,213
And passed
through cleanly

72
00:06:07,253 --> 00:06:10,014
Just be thankful
it didn't catch your femoral artery

73
00:06:10,054 --> 00:06:10,934
To be honest

74
00:06:10,974 --> 00:06:12,574
you were
quite lucky

75
00:06:14,295 --> 00:06:15,535
Lucky，huh？

76
00:06:15,575 --> 00:06:16,575
Right

77
00:06:16,615 --> 00:06:17,815
Alrighty， guys

78
00:06:17,855 --> 00:06:19,095
lunch is served

79
00:06:19,135 --> 00:06:19,855
Wow

80
00:06:19,895 --> 00:06:20,815
that smells good

81
00:06:20,855 --> 00:06:21,815
Heckle

82
00:06:26,216 --> 00:06:26,896
Surprising

83
00:06:26,936 --> 00:06:27,576
isn't it？

84
00:06:27,616 --> 00:06:29,296
It tastes
delicious

85
00:06:29,336 --> 00:06:31,136
Heckle may look
more like a pickpocket

86
00:06:31,176 --> 00:06:32,656
But he's
actually quite the chef

87
00:06:32,696 --> 00:06:33,696
don't you
agree？Hey

88
00:06:33,736 --> 00:06:36,016
and what in the
hell did you mean by that？

89
00:06:36,416 --> 00:06:37,698
This，my
friends，is，chicken

90
00:06:37,738 --> 00:06:38,339
marrango

91
00:06:38,379 --> 00:06:39,019
The，key，to，the

92
00:06:39,059 --> 00:06:39,861
dish，is，the，sauce

93
00:06:39,901 --> 00:06:40,501
You，have，to，get

94
00:06:40,541 --> 00:06:41,262
it，just，right

95
00:06:41,302 --> 00:06:41,943
It's，based，on，a

96
00:06:41,983 --> 00:06:42,664
recipe，from，a

97
00:06:42,704 --> 00:06:43,585
threestar，French

98
00:06:43,625 --> 00:06:44,186
restaurant

99
00:06:44,226 --> 00:06:45,307
called，Le
Petit，Bessin

100
00:06:45,347 --> 00:06:45,908
Don't，care，how

101
00:06:45,948 --> 00:06:46,589
it's，made，just

102
00:06:46,629 --> 00:06:47,310
how，it，tastes

103
00:06:47,350 --> 00:06:48,551
A，rent，like
you，just，can't

104
00:06:48,591 --> 00:06:49,192
appreciate，the

105
00:06:49,232 --> 00:06:49,793
subtleties，of

106
00:06:49,833 --> 00:06:50,554
fine，cuisine

107
00:06:50,594 --> 00:06:51,115
You，know，this

108
00:06:51,155 --> 00:06:51,795
would，taste，even

109
00:06:51,835 --> 00:06:52,396
better，with，a

110
00:06:52,436 --> 00:06:53,718
dash，of，soy，sauce

111
00:06:53,758 --> 00:06:54,959
Soy，sauce？

112
00:06:54,999 --> 00:06:56,121
Not，that，again

113
00:06:56,161 --> 00:06:57,002
You，put，soy，sauce

114
00:06:57,042 --> 00:06:58,003
on，everything

115
00:06:58,043 --> 00:06:58,884
I，give，up

116
00:06:58,924 --> 00:07:00,206
Now，this，is，dining

117
00:07:01,559 --> 00:07:02,800
When you sit
down to eat

118
00:07:02,840 --> 00:07:04,600
this is how
it should be

119
00:07:06,522 --> 00:07:08,043
What a waste

120
00:07:08,083 --> 00:07:09,004
All my life

121
00:07:09,044 --> 00:07:11,526
everything I did
was to make money

122
00:07:11,566 --> 00:07:13,487
But while I was
earning all those millions

123
00:07:13,527 --> 00:07:16,048
I lost things
much more valuable

124
00:07:16,089 --> 00:07:17,650
Both of my parents

125
00:07:17,690 --> 00:07:19,731
and my only
brother disowned me

126
00:07:19,771 --> 00:07:22,373
Even my wife and
son were murdered

127
00:07:22,533 --> 00:07:25,055
I always wanted
to live peacefully

128
00:07:25,095 --> 00:07:27,536
And dine like we'
re doing right now

129
00:07:38,179 --> 00:07:41,343
Money can really
change the way people act

130
00:07:41,384 --> 00:07:44,187
Allow me to share
a good example with you

131
00:07:48,332 --> 00:07:49,213
Five years ago

132
00:07:49,253 --> 00:07:51,414
a covert banking
organisation was formed

133
00:07:51,454 --> 00:07:54,937
to facilitate the
underground funds flowing throughout Germany

134
00:07:54,977 --> 00:07:58,100
What these guys
pulled off was absolutely amazing

135
00:07:58,140 --> 00:08:01,342
Within days of the dirty money flowing in through shady companies

136
00:08:01,382 --> 00:08:03,945
It would come out
the other side perfectly clean

137
00:08:04,425 --> 00:08:06,266
係錢laundering operation？

138
00:08:06,306 --> 00:08:07,427
Exactly

139
00:08:07,467 --> 00:08:08,227
On top of that

140
00:08:08,267 --> 00:08:11,706
this organisation
functioned in many ways like a real bank

141
00:08:11,746 --> 00:08:15,306
Making loans and
investing in speculative transactions

142
00:08:15,346 --> 00:08:17,345
And it grew
unbelievably fast

143
00:08:17,385 --> 00:08:18,465
In five
short years

144
00:08:18,505 --> 00:08:19,705
they'd
made a fortune

145
00:08:19,745 --> 00:08:21,025
Hot damn

146
00:08:21,065 --> 00:08:22,584
But that all
changed this year

147
00:08:22,624 --> 00:08:25,384
Because the man
who'd been running the show suddenly vanished

148
00:08:25,424 --> 00:08:26,824
He hasn't been
seen in months

149
00:08:26,864 --> 00:08:28,823
and no one
knows where he went

150
00:08:29,263 --> 00:08:31,063
Guess what
happened then？

151
00:08:32,234 --> 00:08:34,155
All of it
fell apart

152
00:08:34,676 --> 00:08:37,358
The entire
operation imploded

153
00:08:37,758 --> 00:08:40,200
The associates
that remained started fighting over

154
00:08:40,240 --> 00:08:43,282
who would get
what was left and who would be in charge

155
00:08:44,923 --> 00:08:47,245
Most of them
ended up killing each other

156
00:08:47,285 --> 00:08:49,927
The entire
operation disappeared

157
00:08:50,007 --> 00:08:52,129
If only they'd
been sensible

158
00:08:52,169 --> 00:08:55,290
And talked things
out while sharing a fine dinner

159
00:08:59,059 --> 00:08:59,820
So

160
00:09:00,541 --> 00:09:01,422
你諗嗰個係殺人案，定係佢跑咗？

161
00:09:01,462 --> 00:09:02,544
Keep up，Doc
我講係個頭髮蓬鬆嘅人，佢消失咗

162
00:09:02,584 --> 00:09:04,546
所以，係被綁架、殺死，定係咩啊？

163
00:09:04,586 --> 00:09:05,588
噢，唔係，我好確定佢仲係活著

164
00:09:05,628 --> 00:09:06,349
其實佢可能係冒充學生，喺某處

165
00:09:06,389 --> 00:09:07,109
學生？

166
00:09:21,176 --> 00:09:22,017
That's right

167
00:09:22,057 --> 00:09:23,498
I forgot
to tell you

168
00:09:23,538 --> 00:09:25,741
I left out
something important

169
00:09:25,781 --> 00:09:27,142
According
to my sources

170
00:09:27,182 --> 00:09:28,143
the guy
who created

171
00:09:28,183 --> 00:09:30,826
that money laundering organisation five years ago

172
00:09:30,866 --> 00:09:32,307
was just a kid

173
00:09:32,668 --> 00:09:34,429
15 years old

174
00:09:38,954 --> 00:09:40,515
15 years old？

175
00:09:41,437 --> 00:09:43,119
Your sources
must be nuts

176
00:09:43,159 --> 00:09:45,442
No way a kid
could pull off something like that

177
00:09:45,482 --> 00:09:46,283
But it's true

178
00:09:46,323 --> 00:09:47,845
this kid did it

179
00:09:48,006 --> 00:09:50,369
It's as if he was
conducting his own experiment

180
00:09:50,409 --> 00:09:52,732
To see how
adults deal with money

181
00:09:52,973 --> 00:09:57,218
As though he were
a child playing around with a line of ants

182
00:09:57,860 --> 00:09:59,501
Where was
all this？

183
00:09:59,542 --> 00:10:02,786
Do you know where
this covert banking operation was based？

184
00:10:03,353 --> 00:10:06,036
The organisation
was headquartered in Dusseldorf

185
00:10:06,076 --> 00:10:08,680
But the kid at
the top was constantly on the move

186
00:10:08,720 --> 00:10:11,763
He controlled the
entire operation from wherever he was

187
00:10:11,803 --> 00:10:12,764
You know？

188
00:10:13,445 --> 00:10:16,249
And did anybody
figure out the last place that he was seen？

189
00:10:16,289 --> 00:10:17,970
Before he
disappeared？

190
00:10:18,211 --> 00:10:19,933
That's all the
details I know

191
00:10:19,973 --> 00:10:22,416
But I heard right
after their young boss went missing

192
00:10:22,456 --> 00:10:25,780
All of his money
hungry underlings went rushing to Munich

193
00:10:25,860 --> 00:10:27,462
To Munich，eh？

194
00:10:27,502 --> 00:10:28,103
Hey，Doc

195
00:10:28,143 --> 00:10:29,224
why the long face？

196
00:10:29,264 --> 00:10:30,585
What's going on？

197
00:10:31,426 --> 00:10:32,307
I know

198
00:10:32,347 --> 00:10:35,350
let's invite that
man down the hill up here for lunch

199
00:10:35,471 --> 00:10:36,952
Sure，why not？

200
00:10:36,992 --> 00:10:38,473
That's a good idea

201
00:10:38,714 --> 00:10:39,555
Sorry，Doctor

202
00:10:39,595 --> 00:10:40,996
but that man'
s my bodyguard

203
00:10:41,036 --> 00:10:42,998
He needs to
stay down there

204
00:10:43,399 --> 00:10:46,561
But haven't you
been officially declared dead already？

205
00:10:46,682 --> 00:10:49,885
You still think there are people out there who wanna do you harm？

206
00:10:49,965 --> 00:10:52,808
Are you planning
to live the rest of your life in fear？

207
00:10:53,129 --> 00:10:54,970
Hiding behind
a bodyguard？

208
00:11:06,687 --> 00:11:10,488
Helmut has been
with me for a very long time indeed

209
00:11:11,328 --> 00:11:12,728
Go ahead， son

210
00:11:12,768 --> 00:11:14,289
Go and get Helmut

211
00:11:14,329 --> 00:11:15,529
So that's his name

212
00:11:15,569 --> 00:11:17,089
He wouldn't
talk to me at all

213
00:11:17,129 --> 00:11:18,249
I bet

214
00:11:18,370 --> 00:11:22,090
Go and tell him
that his duties as my bodyguard are over

215
00:11:24,489 --> 00:11:27,499
He's the only one
left who's like family to me

216
00:11:27,539 --> 00:11:28,944
Ask him to join us

217
00:11:28,984 --> 00:11:32,797
Have him come here so we can discuss our future at this table

218
00:11:32,837 --> 00:11:33,798
Okay

219
00:11:58,525 --> 00:11:59,806
Mr， Helmut

220
00:11:59,846 --> 00:12:01,048
lunch time

221
00:12:01,088 --> 00:12:03,651
They want you to
come up and join us

222
00:12:07,737 --> 00:12:10,540
Tim is right up
there in the mountain villa

223
00:12:11,663 --> 00:12:12,864
You do want
to kill him

224
00:12:12,904 --> 00:12:13,905
don't you？

225
00:12:27,579 --> 00:12:29,140
Is something
the matter？

226
00:12:29,502 --> 00:12:32,544
That was a security breach signal from Helmut

227
00:12:34,026 --> 00:12:35,627
Unfortunately

228
00:12:35,988 --> 00:12:38,270
I think he's
already dead

229
00:12:38,992 --> 00:12:39,552
Wait

230
00:12:39,592 --> 00:12:41,394
someone's
coming after ya？

231
00:12:41,514 --> 00:12:42,716
There's no telling

232
00:12:42,756 --> 00:12:43,556
but

233
00:12:44,077 --> 00:12:47,280
I'd say someone's
heading up here even as we speak

234
00:12:49,002 --> 00:12:51,004
Mr， Helmut Czar

235
00:13:35,319 --> 00:13:36,761
Go tell him

236
00:13:38,167 --> 00:13:40,611
You have to tell
him to run away

237
00:13:41,736 --> 00:13:44,341
Hurry，go and
tell Tenma now

238
00:13:45,114 --> 00:13:46,634
Tell him，damn it

239
00:13:52,919 --> 00:13:53,959
Lady

240
00:13:54,360 --> 00:13:56,041
I said go tell him

241
00:13:56,081 --> 00:13:56,842
But your leg

242
00:13:56,882 --> 00:13:57,683
you've been shot

243
00:13:57,723 --> 00:13:58,723
Don't
worry about me

244
00:13:58,763 --> 00:13:59,523
go

245
00:13:59,604 --> 00:14:00,724
Hang on

246
00:14:00,805 --> 00:14:02,686
who's
shooting at us？

247
00:14:06,528 --> 00:14:07,368
Did…

248
00:14:07,448 --> 00:14:08,568
did you get him？

249
00:14:08,608 --> 00:14:09,608
I'm not sure

250
00:14:09,648 --> 00:14:11,367
but now's your
chance to run for it

251
00:14:11,407 --> 00:14:12,367
get going

252
00:14:12,407 --> 00:14:13,647
But I can't go

253
00:14:13,687 --> 00:14:15,247
You're out
here in the open

254
00:14:15,287 --> 00:14:16,766
I can't help you

255
00:14:16,846 --> 00:14:17,446
Listen

256
00:14:17,486 --> 00:14:18,326
I can handle this

257
00:14:18,366 --> 00:14:19,006
just go

258
00:14:19,046 --> 00:14:20,246
No，you can't

259
00:14:20,286 --> 00:14:21,685
We have to
go and hide

260
00:14:21,725 --> 00:14:22,645
quick

261
00:14:23,805 --> 00:14:24,685
Well…

262
00:14:25,445 --> 00:14:27,244
looks like
I was wrong

263
00:14:27,924 --> 00:14:30,524
She didn't want
to kill Temma after all

264
00:14:33,359 --> 00:14:34,481
You gonna
be alright

265
00:14:34,521 --> 00:14:35,441
ma'am？

266
00:14:36,243 --> 00:14:37,605
I'll be fine

267
00:14:37,645 --> 00:14:38,646
but I think

268
00:14:38,686 --> 00:14:41,769
he's already heading up the hill on his way to the villa

269
00:14:41,810 --> 00:14:42,771
Not a chance

270
00:14:42,811 --> 00:14:43,932
I would've
seen him from here

271
00:14:43,972 --> 00:14:47,096
There's really only one path to get all the way up to that house

272
00:14:47,136 --> 00:14:48,538
What are you
talking about？

273
00:14:48,578 --> 00:14:49,940
I've explored
this whole mountain

274
00:14:49,980 --> 00:14:51,782
and this path is
the only way up there

275
00:14:51,822 --> 00:14:54,665
All the other
paths lead to cliffs no one can climb

276
00:14:54,865 --> 00:14:56,386
So then if we
guard this trail

277
00:14:56,426 --> 00:15:00,709
there's no other way Roberto will be able to get far enough up the mountain to get to the villa

278
00:15:00,749 --> 00:15:02,629
You mean you
know this guy？

279
00:15:02,670 --> 00:15:04,350
I know
him too well

280
00:15:04,551 --> 00:15:05,951
Roberto's
after Tenma

281
00:15:05,991 --> 00:15:07,312
he wants
to kill him

282
00:15:07,352 --> 00:15:08,433
You know Tenma？

283
00:15:08,473 --> 00:15:09,673
So who are you
ma'am？

284
00:15:09,713 --> 00:15:11,354
Are you a
friend of his？

285
00:15:18,518 --> 00:15:19,957
What you
laughing about，Ma'am？

286
00:15:19,997 --> 00:15:21,356
Don't make me
sound so old

287
00:15:21,396 --> 00:15:22,955
stop calling me Ma'am

288
00:15:22,995 --> 00:15:24,195
Now get
outta here，kid

289
00:15:24,235 --> 00:15:25,994
You get up
there and tell Tenma

290
00:15:26,034 --> 00:15:27,753
Tell him to
run away quick

291
00:15:28,073 --> 00:15:29,675
But…Ma'am
I mean lady

292
00:15:29,715 --> 00:15:30,796
you're bleeding

293
00:15:30,836 --> 00:15:31,757
I'll be alright

294
00:15:31,797 --> 00:15:33,238
you just get up
there and warn him

295
00:15:33,278 --> 00:15:35,721
But your leg
looks like it's bleeding a lot

296
00:15:35,761 --> 00:15:37,523
Tenma must have
heard those gunshots

297
00:15:37,563 --> 00:15:40,125
I bet he's headed
down here to take care of that guy

298
00:15:40,165 --> 00:15:41,726
But that'
s not good

299
00:15:41,847 --> 00:15:44,529
Roberta wants Tenma to come down here and try to save us

300
00:15:44,569 --> 00:15:46,010
so he can kill him

301
00:15:46,051 --> 00:15:47,452
Don't you
see it's a trap

302
00:15:47,492 --> 00:15:49,374
and we're the
bait to bring him here？

303
00:15:49,414 --> 00:15:50,734
But what can we do
Ma'am？

304
00:15:50,774 --> 00:15:52,614
If we try to make
a run for it with your leg

305
00:15:52,654 --> 00:15:53,854
you might
bleed to death

306
00:15:53,894 --> 00:15:55,134
Stop calling me Ma'am

307
00:15:55,174 --> 00:15:56,654
what did I
tell you？

308
00:16:00,294 --> 00:16:02,774
So just what are
you to Tenma anyway？

309
00:16:02,814 --> 00:16:03,854
I'm his friend

310
00:16:03,894 --> 00:16:04,574
what about you

311
00:16:04,614 --> 00:16:06,414
Ma'am，I mean Lady？

312
00:16:09,294 --> 00:16:11,174
Aren't you a
friend of Tenma's too？

313
00:16:11,214 --> 00:16:11,894
You must be

314
00:16:11,934 --> 00:16:13,414
cause even though
you're hurt really bad

315
00:16:13,454 --> 00:16:15,374
you're still
trying to save him

316
00:16:16,381 --> 00:16:17,784
I'm not
trying to be nosy

317
00:16:17,824 --> 00:16:18,624
but

318
00:16:18,665 --> 00:16:19,506
You like Tenma

319
00:16:19,546 --> 00:16:20,548
don't you？

320
00:16:20,588 --> 00:16:21,710
Are you his
girlfriend？

321
00:16:21,750 --> 00:16:23,952
You just keep
watching that side

322
00:16:28,320 --> 00:16:29,803
Do you like Tenma？

323
00:16:29,843 --> 00:16:31,606
Yeah，I like
him a whole lot

324
00:16:31,646 --> 00:16:33,968
What exactly do
you like about him？

325
00:16:34,130 --> 00:16:35,452
Lots of things

326
00:16:35,492 --> 00:16:37,254
What do you
like about him？

327
00:16:43,573 --> 00:16:44,975
I know you
're there

328
00:16:45,015 --> 00:16:46,217
Crawl around
all you want

329
00:16:46,257 --> 00:16:49,101
But you'd be
pretty stupid to shoot me again

330
00:16:49,382 --> 00:16:50,784
I already told you

331
00:16:50,824 --> 00:16:51,385
If I die

332
00:16:51,425 --> 00:16:52,907
that picture of
Johann as a child

333
00:16:52,947 --> 00:16:56,593
That you want so badly will automatically be sent straight to the VKA

334
00:16:56,633 --> 00:16:57,394
I mean it

335
00:16:57,434 --> 00:16:59,157
this is your
last warning

336
00:16:59,197 --> 00:17:00,799
If you ever want
to see that photo

337
00:17:00,839 --> 00:17:03,442
then you'd better
get the hell outta here right now

338
00:17:07,181 --> 00:17:10,146
So that photo you'
ve got is something you really want？

339
00:17:10,186 --> 00:17:11,467
It's a lie

340
00:17:11,788 --> 00:17:13,470
and it
might not work

341
00:17:13,591 --> 00:17:16,435
He's too smart to
fall for such a trick

342
00:17:16,475 --> 00:17:18,677
Lady，are you
feeling alright？

343
00:17:18,838 --> 00:17:20,481
I'm starting to fade

344
00:17:20,521 --> 00:17:22,322
I've lost a
lot of blood

345
00:17:24,136 --> 00:17:25,176
Now go

346
00:17:25,817 --> 00:17:26,858
well，get
out of here

347
00:17:26,898 --> 00:17:28,220
save yourself

348
00:17:28,260 --> 00:17:29,901
I can't
just leave you

349
00:17:29,941 --> 00:17:31,382
Tenma's on his way

350
00:17:31,422 --> 00:17:32,743
He would've
been here by now

351
00:17:32,783 --> 00:17:34,225
He's gotta
be headed here

352
00:17:34,265 --> 00:17:35,986
I mean it，Look

353
00:17:36,026 --> 00:17:38,708
there's no way he
would ever come to save me

354
00:17:39,870 --> 00:17:42,071
Nothing but a
waste of time

355
00:17:45,995 --> 00:17:47,195
Sailor

356
00:17:47,837 --> 00:17:49,598
Sailor
where are you？

357
00:17:51,475 --> 00:17:53,556
Tenma，我喺度

358
00:17:53,596 --> 00:17:55,156
Just stay there

359
00:17:55,516 --> 00:17:57,597
我嚟到接你，Didier

360
00:17:57,637 --> 00:17:59,078
Don't move

361
00:17:59,638 --> 00:18:00,918
If you try
to come get us

362
00:18:00,958 --> 00:18:03,519
there's a man
here that's going to shoot you

363
00:18:03,559 --> 00:18:04,720
That's why he
's come here

364
00:18:04,760 --> 00:18:06,440
Tenma，to kill you

365
00:18:06,480 --> 00:18:07,081
Wait

366
00:18:07,121 --> 00:18:08,081
I know that voice

367
00:18:08,121 --> 00:18:09,481
but it can't be…

368
00:18:10,242 --> 00:18:10,962
Tenma

369
00:18:11,002 --> 00:18:12,882
this lady's a
friend of yours

370
00:18:12,922 --> 00:18:15,763
She's been shot
and she's bleeding a lot

371
00:18:16,283 --> 00:18:17,523
It's Ava

372
00:18:18,044 --> 00:18:19,164
You can't die now

373
00:18:19,204 --> 00:18:20,684
not when I'
m so close

374
00:18:20,724 --> 00:18:22,084
I'm handing you
over to the police

375
00:18:22,124 --> 00:18:22,565
Kenzo

376
00:18:22,605 --> 00:18:25,405
so you can rot in
jail for the rest of your life

377
00:18:25,445 --> 00:18:26,605
You hear me？

378
00:18:26,645 --> 00:18:29,606
You've got decades of suffering ahead of you

379
00:18:29,846 --> 00:18:33,527
I want every
waking moment to hurt for dumping me

380
00:18:33,687 --> 00:18:34,527
Stop shouting

381
00:18:34,567 --> 00:18:36,288
you're
straining yourself

382
00:18:40,849 --> 00:18:41,889
Hey，Didier

383
00:18:41,929 --> 00:18:43,330
just tell me if
you can hear me

384
00:18:43,370 --> 00:18:44,250
okay？

385
00:18:44,290 --> 00:18:46,610
Can you tell
where the shooter is？

386
00:18:48,891 --> 00:18:50,531
No，I don't know

387
00:18:50,571 --> 00:18:52,132
I've got no
clue where he is

388
00:18:52,172 --> 00:18:54,052
or even if he'
s still here

389
00:18:56,453 --> 00:18:58,133
Stop
yelling to him

390
00:18:58,654 --> 00:19:00,774
I need Tenma alive

391
00:19:02,887 --> 00:19:03,528
Hang in there

392
00:19:03,568 --> 00:19:04,929
he's
getting close

393
00:19:04,969 --> 00:19:06,171
He's not coming
Tieda

394
00:19:06,211 --> 00:19:07,412
you're wrong

395
00:19:08,173 --> 00:19:11,136
He would never
come to my rescue

396
00:19:13,660 --> 00:19:14,741
It's all
over for me

397
00:19:14,781 --> 00:19:16,423
Don't die， please

398
00:19:24,834 --> 00:19:27,556
Why would he ever
wanna rescue me？

399
00:19:53,485 --> 00:19:54,286
天色好

400
00:19:59,565 --> 00:20:03,887
What's all this？
Why'd you bring me out here？ It's time for lunch

401
00:20:04,087 --> 00:20:06,608
Your leg has been
healing up nicely

402
00:20:06,688 --> 00:20:10,889
And I thought you'd enjoy eating lunch outside in this beautiful sunshine

403
00:20:11,249 --> 00:20:12,290
You're a
lucky woman

404
00:20:12,330 --> 00:20:13,250
you know

405
00:20:13,290 --> 00:20:14,970
What do you
mean lucky？

406
00:20:15,250 --> 00:20:16,451
Just that

407
00:20:16,491 --> 00:20:18,492
The guy who shot
you was a real pro

408
00:20:18,532 --> 00:20:20,132
He knew what
he was doing

409
00:20:20,172 --> 00:20:24,613
He understood how difficult it would be for him to infiltrate this mountain villa

410
00:20:26,513 --> 00:20:28,993
There's only one
path to get up here

411
00:20:29,033 --> 00:20:31,633
And there are
security cameras everywhere

412
00:20:31,673 --> 00:20:34,833
He also knew this
villa would be guarded by experienced men

413
00:20:34,873 --> 00:20:38,233
So it would be
like he was attacking an alpine fortress

414
00:20:38,273 --> 00:20:40,473
That was the
reason he used you

415
00:20:40,633 --> 00:20:41,233
Hold on

416
00:20:41,273 --> 00:20:43,153
what do you
mean he used me？

417
00:20:43,193 --> 00:20:44,313
It's simple

418
00:20:44,353 --> 00:20:46,154
He must have
figured that a pretty woman

419
00:20:46,194 --> 00:20:47,554
making an
unexpected visit

420
00:20:47,594 --> 00:20:51,276
would have a much better chance of getting all the way up here than he would

421
00:20:51,316 --> 00:20:52,436
But when you
betrayed him

422
00:20:52,476 --> 00:20:54,037
his whole
plan was sunk

423
00:20:54,077 --> 00:20:55,197
He had no plan B

424
00:20:55,237 --> 00:20:57,078
there were no
other options for him

425
00:20:57,118 --> 00:21:00,079
So he got out of
here quick and cut his losses

426
00:21:00,119 --> 00:21:01,479
So then
he got away

427
00:21:01,519 --> 00:21:02,600
That's right

428
00:21:02,640 --> 00:21:04,440
We searched the
whole mountain

429
00:21:07,053 --> 00:21:08,654
This here's a
special dish

430
00:21:08,694 --> 00:21:10,535
It's called
chicken morango

431
00:21:10,896 --> 00:21:12,738
I tried to
recreate the recipe

432
00:21:12,778 --> 00:21:15,459
but I can't
guarantee it'll be any good

433
00:21:16,500 --> 00:21:19,462
You know there's
another way you were very lucky

434
00:21:19,743 --> 00:21:24,186
You were lucky to
have a great doctor like Doctor Tenma treating you

435
00:21:27,829 --> 00:21:29,789
So is Tenma
still here？

436
00:21:29,829 --> 00:21:30,589
No

437
00:21:30,709 --> 00:21:32,109
he already left

438
00:21:32,149 --> 00:21:33,110
Where to？

439
00:21:33,150 --> 00:21:36,070
Think he said
something about going to Munich

440
00:21:36,190 --> 00:21:41,630
Munich，eh？

441
00:21:41,670 --> 00:21:42,790
Alright

442
00:21:42,830 --> 00:21:46,030
let's see if you
and I can enjoy this chicken

443
00:21:46,270 --> 00:21:48,391
I got a feeling
you're like me

444
00:21:48,591 --> 00:21:51,071
I bet it's been a
long time since you sat down

445
00:21:51,111 --> 00:21:53,311
and enjoyed a
meal in peace

